Modifications made in this repository (Apache-2.0 §4(b)):
- files were moved to new module paths under CalabiYau/, renamed into the
  CalabiYau namespace where applicable, and imports among them were
  rewritten accordingly;
- files were converted to the Lean module system (`module` header,
  `public import`, `@[expose] public section`), with a compatibility
  preamble after the imports (`set_option maxSynthPendingDepth 3`, as in the
  upstream lakefile, and, in files with private declarations,
  `backward.privateInPublic`);
- a one-line provenance comment was prepended to each file;
- declarations not needed by this development were removed, some files
  were split, and a few proofs were adapted where the module system hides
  Mathlib definition bodies.
